{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "english", "appid": 548430, "month": "2021-12", "window": 1, "start_date": 1638316800, "end_date": 1639007999, "month_true_total": 2814, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:23:32 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "105491705", "author": {"steamid": "76561198037992879", "personaname": "sun enjoyer", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/crashst/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 11711, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5410, "last_played": 1677857042, "avatar": "c4821fc0cfa8e23e757826708622313322ca5bd7"}, "language": "english", "review": "i like this game", "timestamp_created": 1639007934, "timestamp_updated": 1639007934, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "105491606", "author": {"steamid": "76561199033804895", "personaname": "The Dead King", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199033804895/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 26662, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 10318, "last_played": 1763193299, "avatar": "62037e1fbae5c2444c0665e13b1a5a3ebf156a3c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Even before the release of the first season, this game is alot of fun with whats been a great development team behind all of it.  Lots of cosmetics to grab without pulling your wallet out, fun gunplay with good amounts of variation to work with your taste in game play. Game modes are all good and to the point.  Enemies are both fun and tough in numbers which they make sure that number is alot at times. All the maps are procedural generated so it keeps you on your toes are you explore the never ending caves.  So far theres really nothing that i can find to complain or find lacking.  Plus getting drunk at the bar jamming it out to classical music cant get any better and all you have to do is just simply mine some ores here and there.  Its a job and someones gotta do it. For rock and stone gentledwarves", "timestamp_created": 1639007790, "timestamp_updated": 1639007790, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "105490604", "author": {"steamid": "76561198001500639", "personaname": "Garzorz", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/garzorz/", "num_games_owned": 397, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 13668, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7560, "last_played": 1743309373, "avatar": "3084ebe8372deaa25e20c391d65bab2eb821c887"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of the best done themes I've seen for a game.  The game has an amazing amount of polish, thoughtfulness and detail that makes for an astounding world to jump into!\n\nThe gameplay is fun to play, addicting, and especially  amazing to play with friends!", "timestamp_created": 1639006037, "timestamp_updated": 1639006037, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "105490032", "author": {"steamid": "76561198252669410", "personaname": "That Guy", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198252669410/", "num_games_owne